&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius Token Factory is building fast, reliable, and cost-efficient inference services for frontier models. As a Senior Machine Learning Engineer on our Applied AI team, you will own model and endpoint optimization from model artifacts through production deployment. Your work will span model internals, inference engines, serving architecture, and benchmarking, with a focus on impr

description_html:
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director, Learning eXperience Curator is a regionally embedded people leader responsible for translating The Learning Collective’s learning, performance, and growth strategy into practical, high‑impact execution on learning experiences across a multi‑region portfolio. This role develops and leads in-person and virtual learning experiences across international regions in Europe, Africa, Australia &amp;amp; New Zealand, and Asia &amp;amp; Middle East. In this role you will ensure learning experiences are globally aligned and locally resonant, while building scalable delivery capacity through a strong Train‑the‑Trainer program and Learning Ambassador network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Participate in setting the global learning strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring that local and regional cultural needs and differences are represented and considered. Drive its delivery across international markets, ensuring regional consistency while addressing local learning needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish strategic partnerships with Regional Presidents and Regional PX VPs&lt;/strong&gt; to translate the TLC Strategy into regional and local deliverables and learning experiences. Define regional learning agendas aligned with the global strategy and, where required, reflecting varying levels of learning maturity, in line with TLC standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead needs analyses with PX Business Partners and leaders; &lt;/strong&gt;convert insight into scalable, measurable learning solutions that improve performance, skills, and capability development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and facilitate high‑impact learning or group coaching experiences&lt;/strong&gt; (live and virtual) that drive behavior change, team effectiveness, and high performance across multiple cultures and seniority levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Train‑the‑Trainer (TTT) for International: &lt;/strong&gt;design and deliver TTT recruitment and enablement, develop facilitator standards, build practice and quality loops (observation, feedback, co‑facilitation), and sustain a facilitator community rhythm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through a matrix: &lt;/strong&gt;directly manage relevant local learning roles and provide support and coaching to the extended TLC team, Learning Ambassadors, and cross‑regional contributors to ensure consistent quality and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure governance and coherence: &lt;/strong&gt;reduce duplication, maintain quality, and partner with internal content/design/communications and external partners where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed measurement: &lt;/strong&gt;define success metrics and reporting, share executive‑ready insights, and continuously improve experiences based on data and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven senior learning leader with significant experience designing and facilitating learning experiences (live and virtual) that deliver measurable behaviour change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leader with experience coaching and developing teams across geographies, cultures, and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident working in matrixed organizations with dual reporting lines and high stakeholder complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culturally fluent and agile - able to tailor content and approach across regions, audiences, role functions, and business contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching capability strongly preferred; ICF accreditation (or progress toward) is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, adaptable and experienced in creative environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and partner with senior leaders and cross‑functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in adult learning principles, leadership frameworks, and learning measurement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There will be travel required in this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with digital learning platforms, learning analytics, and modern learning technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You join a vibrant global community with the opportunity to channel your passion every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A modern office environment designed for you, empowering you to bring your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Investment in your professional growth and development enabling you to thrive in our vibrant community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The space to accelerate progress, positively disrupt and create what happens next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We give you the platform to champion positive change, with the opportunity to contribute to our social impact, diversity, equity and inclusion initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We provide an excellent range of benefits like private medical cover, a generous pension scheme, life assurance, income protection, plus loads of music industry perks. There’s also time off over winter break&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music is committed to equal opportunities and to providing a respectful, inclusive environment. We welcome applications from all backgrounds and do not discriminate on the basis of protected characteristics. Reasonable adjustments are available throughout the recruitment process, please let us know what support you need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an active part of a culturally and socially diverse society, Sony Music’s aim is that our workforce is diverse and inclusive. Sony Music is an equal opportunity employer and supports workforce diversity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We employ, retain, promote and otherwise treat all employees and job applicants according to their merit, qualifications, competence and talent. We apply this policy without regard to any individual’s sex, race, religion, origin, age, sexual orientation, marital status, medical condition or disability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://tools.sonymusiccreative.com/privacy/PCP_UK.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to read our privacy policy before beginning the application process as you will need to agree to the terms of the policy before submitting your information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that applicants must be at least 18 years of age.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
